12. Instruction: Write a JavaScript function to calculate the factorial of a given number.
12. Input:
<noinput>
12. Output:
// Function to calculate factorial
function factorial(n) {
    if (n == 0 || n == 1)
        return 1;
    else
        return(n * factorial(n-1));
}
// test the function
